        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e1a30c5-b1e0-4984-b3f4-67f01f9ebfef).Image",
        "Description": "The infamous GAMA Facility in Hokkaido. Known for its incredible equipment and expert staff, as well as organ harvesting. We are here to change that. \rWe want you to eliminate the head doctor, head surgeon, head of the morgue and the director of the facility to cause great chaos and severly hurt the facility.\rFeel free to kill anyone else, just make sure you get out alive and dont expose yourself.\rGood luck, 47.",
